Screening was conducted conservatively. Studies were included if they were randomized trials (or cluster/group RCTs) 
evaluating at least one system- or provider-targeted QI strategy (e.g., case management, team changes, electronic 
registries, facilitated relay, clinician education, audit & feedback, financial incentives) in outpatient settings for 
people with diabetes. Patient-targeted strategies were included when combined with system/provider strategies. 
Exclusions were primarily methodology papers, systematic reviews, cross-sectional studies, or clinical trials focusing 
solely on patient-level behavioral/dietary interventions without explicit system or provider QI components. All original
study indices were preserved.
