  ### 3. Additional context:                                                                                            
  Key screening principles applied:                                                                                     
  1. Study design: Only randomized trials (including cluster RCTs) were eligible                                        
  2. Population: Adults with diabetes in outpatient settings                                                            
  3. Intervention: Must include at least one system-targeted (CM, TC, EPR, FR, CQI) or provider-targeted (AF, CE, CR,   
  FI) QI strategy                                                                                                       
  4. Patient-targeted strategies (PE, PSM, PR) alone were excluded unless combined with system/provider strategies      
  5. Methodological papers, systematic reviews, commentaries, and observational studies were excluded                   
  6. Conservative approach: When uncertain about whether an intervention included system/provider components, studies   
  were included                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                        
  The 29 excluded studies fell into these categories:                                                                   
  - Patient-targeted only interventions (18 studies): Self-management, education, SMS, apps without system/provider     
  components                                                                                                            
  - Wrong study design (4 studies): Observational, systematic review, commentaries                                      
  - Methodological papers (7 studies): Papers about research methods, not clinical trials                               
                                                                                                                        
