│ {"study_index": 297, "title": "Effectiveness of targeted insulin-adherence interventions for glycemic control using  │
│ predictive analytics among patients with type 2 diabetes: a randomized clinical trial", "abstract": "IMPORTANCE      │
│ Patient adherence to antidiabetic medications, especially insulin, remains poor, leading to adverse outcomes and     │
