│ (P\xa0<\xa00.001) were significantly increased in the experimental group compared with the control group.            │
│ Conclusions Simulation education and case management added to routine DSME effectively improved glycemic control in  │
│ T2DM patients. Wiley Online Library"}, {"study_index": 299, "title": "Effect of telephone follow-up on adherence to  │
